    "statementMarkdown": "Positive real numbers $a_{1}, a_{2}, \\ldots, a_{2024}$ are written on the blackboard. A move consists of choosing two numbers $x$ and $y$ on the blackboard, erasing them and writing the number $\\frac{x^{2}+6 x y+y^{2}}{x+y}$ on the blackboard. After 2023 moves, only one number $c$ will remain on the blackboard. Prove that\n\n$$\nc<2024\\left(a_{1}+a_{2}+\\ldots+a_{2024}\\right)\n$$\n",
